Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ou-mapi-header-php, ou-gromox-php-mapi, php-fpm, php-redis, php-soap, php-intl, php-mbstring, php-xml, php-curl, redis-server
Conflicts: grommunio-sync
Replaces: grommunio-sync
Provides: grommunio-sync
Description: ActiveSync (EAS) server for Gromox (Office Unbound build)
 grommunio-sync (Z-Push derived) synchronises Exchange ActiveSync devices
 against Gromox. The application tree is in /usr/share/grommunio-sync, the
 configuration in /etc/grommunio-sync/config.php (conffile). nginx and
 php-fpm snippets are shipped as examples under
 /usr/share/doc/ou-grommunio-sync/examples.
